  #step[检查 $p_1 = (0, -1, 2)^T$]
  $ nabla h^T p_1 = -2 + 2 = 0, quad nabla s_3^T p_1 = 3 + 2 = 5 >= 0, quad nabla s_4^T p_1 = -5 + 6 = 1 >= 0. $
  但 $nabla s_1^T p_1 = 0$，要看二阶项：
  $ s_1 (x^((0)) + t p_1) = 1 - 1 - (-t)^2 = -t^2 < 0 quad (t > 0). $
